WEBVTT

00:00:21.290 --> 00:00:26.630
I was shaking after delivering those two million dollars.

00:00:27.590 --> 00:00:33.050
Still, compared to before, armoured car technology has come really far,

00:00:33.050 --> 00:00:35.930
so we can feel more comfortable, right?

00:00:36.430 --> 00:00:41.600
Not so long ago, we were on pins and needles, scared of being robbed.

00:00:42.230 --> 00:00:45.730
Anyway, don't those tourists look happy?

00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:47.560
I envy them.

00:00:48.230 --> 00:00:51.570
We'd also like to be out there in the sun,

00:00:51.570 --> 00:00:54.200
not inside this mess of iron.

00:01:18.550 --> 00:01:20.390
Are... are you alright?

00:01:39.990 --> 00:01:41.200
W- what?

00:02:07.980 --> 00:02:12.820
In any case, we were attacked after the delivery had taken place,

00:02:12.820 --> 00:02:14.980
so there was no loss to our customers' assets.

00:02:14.980 --> 00:02:19.410
Furthermore, it was fortunate that no one was injured during the incident.

00:02:19.990 --> 00:02:28.540
Our "Florida Security" company uses the latest and greatest in armoured technology to ensure your property's safety.

00:02:30.330 --> 00:02:35.000
The armoured car that was hijacked has multi-layered bullet-proof glass.

00:02:35.840 --> 00:02:39.300
The body has the highest levels of strength and heat resistance.

00:02:39.760 --> 00:02:42.510
Its tires cannot be punctured.

00:02:43.390 --> 00:02:46.600
This car is equipped in the latest in protective technology.

00:02:47.060 --> 00:02:48.020
Dumbasses!

00:02:48.640 --> 00:02:51.350
Hijacking a car without cash!

00:02:51.350 --> 00:02:53.150
Dudes gotta be more prepared.

00:02:53.150 --> 00:02:55.150
Bunch of idiots!

00:03:02.450 --> 00:03:03.990
Margaris Almeida?

00:03:08.830 --> 00:03:10.920
Mister Duke Togo.

00:03:14.380 --> 00:03:15.250
Sit down.

00:03:15.960 --> 00:03:17.380
Tell me your business.

00:03:30.390 --> 00:03:40.240
I held my breath and kept waiting while my heart was scratched away

00:03:42.070 --> 00:03:51.580
A minute, a second never felt so long

00:03:52.080 --> 00:04:03.340
I look up at the sky and ask the wind, "Can I fly now?"

00:04:03.550 --> 00:04:09.640
The weak person I was is no more

00:04:09.890 --> 00:04:15.230
I decided to just believe

00:04:16.560 --> 00:04:22.360
With the dreams I once had in my hand now

00:04:22.360 --> 00:04:26.200
I go towards you

00:04:28.120 --> 00:04:33.920
Carrying those emotions I felt when I broke

00:04:33.920 --> 00:04:38.040
I go towards you

00:04:38.040 --> 00:04:42.090
Blown by the wind

00:04:42.840 --> 00:04:47.550
Oh blown

00:04:50.350 --> 00:04:54.980
Florida Chase

00:04:57.400 --> 00:04:59.110
Jose Campos.

00:04:59.770 --> 00:05:01.570
He's the target.

00:05:02.740 --> 00:05:03.690
An immigrant?

00:05:05.240 --> 00:05:08.530
He killed a drug dealer over a drug deal.

00:05:08.910 --> 00:05:12.830
He got a life sentence. He's currently in a Florida state prison.

00:05:13.290 --> 00:05:17.420
He's a simple murderer, yet the aide to the minister of foreign affairs makes the request in person?

00:05:18.960 --> 00:05:23.840
The problem is the smugglers who provide the drugs to the dealers in Florida.

00:05:25.840 --> 00:05:30.810
The authorities in the United States have yet to secure conclusive evidence.

00:05:30.810 --> 00:05:36.730
Campos is in a conspiracy with the drug smuggling ring in our country, and he gets dirty money.

00:05:38.860 --> 00:05:44.360
In America, especially in Florida, there are many immigrants to our country.

00:05:45.440 --> 00:05:48.950
Campos and his kind...

00:05:49.490 --> 00:05:54.450
They should not give the good people of our country a bad name!

00:05:55.660 --> 00:05:58.960
Although in jail, he's still on American soil.

00:05:58.960 --> 00:06:02.380
We've done as much as we can.

00:06:04.670 --> 00:06:09.470
Jose Campos is shrewd and cautious, and thrives despite his condition.

00:06:11.470 --> 00:06:14.520
Now we must come to you.

00:06:14.890 --> 00:06:16.640
Mister Duke Togo.

00:06:31.490 --> 00:06:34.870
Jose Campos has left the Florida State Penitentiary.

00:06:35.790 --> 00:06:37.000
What's going on?

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:41.080
A GPS surveillance system has picked this up.

00:06:42.790 --> 00:06:46.880
The tracking system can tell the location of a criminal out on bail,

00:06:47.260 --> 00:06:51.430
or one given a stay of execution, or out of jail.

00:06:52.010 --> 00:06:55.180
Campos instigated many riots while in prison.

00:06:55.180 --> 00:06:57.350
He was moved after each incident.

00:06:57.890 --> 00:07:01.020
He will be sent to another prison under guard again.

00:07:01.020 --> 00:07:04.610
They will make him wear a tracking device in case of escape.

00:07:04.610 --> 00:07:06.650
Ah! Moving under guard!

00:07:06.650 --> 00:07:07.650
That's so you!

00:07:07.990 --> 00:07:12.110
So in short, if I track this we can find out which prison he will be imprisoned in.

00:07:12.530 --> 00:07:16.540
As soon as it is confirmed, please check the data on the location.

00:07:16.990 --> 00:07:18.330
Yup. Just a minute.

00:07:30.340 --> 00:07:34.260
Look over there! The place called Desperado on the corner.

00:07:34.260 --> 00:07:36.720
Their demerara rum is damn good.

00:07:37.600 --> 00:07:41.890
Oh! The next corner has Madre, damn fine place.

00:07:42.400 --> 00:07:43.850
Shut up Campos!

00:07:50.240 --> 00:07:52.950
Bah, he's acting like we're just out for a drive.

00:08:07.290 --> 00:08:08.210
Jose!

00:08:08.880 --> 00:08:10.260
Good Job Sharon.

00:08:10.260 --> 00:08:11.340
Where's my gun?

00:08:12.260 --> 00:08:12.930
Here.

00:08:13.550 --> 00:08:14.180
Right.

00:08:30.150 --> 00:08:30.860
Yo.

00:08:32.450 --> 00:08:34.450
Sorry for being so noisy.

00:08:35.910 --> 00:08:38.370
I got this phone in prison.

00:08:38.740 --> 00:08:42.410
I was simply telling my friends where we were driving.

00:08:52.130 --> 00:08:52.920
What?

00:08:52.920 --> 00:08:56.470
There's a warning. His ankle bracelet was broken.

00:08:56.840 --> 00:08:59.100
Jose Campos has escaped!

00:09:01.390 --> 00:09:05.440
No way! The security vehicle that was stolen at Key West yesterday...

00:09:06.060 --> 00:09:07.860
They're using it to escape!

00:09:08.310 --> 00:09:13.440
There should be some information on the police computer used for tracking police cars.

00:09:14.360 --> 00:09:16.450
Can you show it on the navigation screen?

00:09:16.860 --> 00:09:17.280
Sure.

00:09:18.700 --> 00:09:20.450
US1, there's a lot of them.

00:09:21.160 --> 00:09:25.750
To think they hijacked the armoured car just for the ride, what a twist!

00:09:28.830 --> 00:09:29.290
Yes?

00:09:30.670 --> 00:09:31.670
Please wait.

00:09:32.920 --> 00:09:34.010
It's Miss Magaris.

00:09:36.510 --> 00:09:37.220
What?

00:09:37.220 --> 00:09:41.720
I just received a report that Jose Campos has escaped. Are you aware?

00:09:42.310 --> 00:09:42.970
Yes.

00:09:42.970 --> 00:09:45.270
Before he gets away, please...

00:09:45.270 --> 00:09:48.730
please get him before he gets away!

00:09:48.730 --> 00:09:53.440
As an external issue, if we assassinate him after we acquit his escape, there is no meaning.

00:09:53.440 --> 00:09:54.490
Please!

00:09:56.740 --> 00:09:58.990
Please keep tracking the chase.

00:09:58.990 --> 00:10:05.500
Also, I would like the schematics of the armoured car which Campos is riding in.

00:10:06.120 --> 00:10:10.630
I suppose I could hack the manufacturer's computer to get it....

00:10:10.630 --> 00:10:14.460
But that car is armoured like a tank!

00:10:14.460 --> 00:10:16.010
What could you do!

00:10:16.010 --> 00:10:20.510
Every fortress invariably has a structural weak point.

00:10:22.390 --> 00:10:23.350
Now, please.

00:10:36.030 --> 00:10:39.360
Jose, there are more and more police after us!

00:10:40.160 --> 00:10:44.120
Unless you open a window, this car is safe.

00:10:44.120 --> 00:10:45.620
Drive easy.

00:10:51.630 --> 00:10:55.630
See? They shoot and don't even leave a dent.

00:10:56.340 --> 00:10:57.260
You're right!

00:11:04.470 --> 00:11:06.180
It's useless!

00:11:06.180 --> 00:11:08.060
Sharon! Give me the wheel.

00:11:26.240 --> 00:11:29.750
Woah! That was awesome, bro!

00:11:30.580 --> 00:11:33.130
You just sit tight and hide.

00:11:33.130 --> 00:11:34.630
Stay out of sight!

00:11:34.630 --> 00:11:36.750
No way, I want to...

00:11:37.250 --> 00:11:39.090
Don't give me lip.

00:11:39.510 --> 00:11:42.220
Just stay there and do what I say.

00:11:42.220 --> 00:11:45.260
Because my plan is perfect.

00:11:46.060 --> 00:11:49.270
That's right! Jose's plan is foolproof, Richie!

00:11:49.890 --> 00:11:52.600
Yeah, I understand, sis.

00:12:06.330 --> 00:12:09.250
And a helicopter with a skilled pilot.

00:12:09.250 --> 00:12:12.460
I got you everything you ordered.

00:12:12.460 --> 00:12:16.630
You know, because you needed it so quickly, it was quite troublesome.

00:12:26.600 --> 00:12:29.430
What are you going to do this time?

00:12:29.770 --> 00:12:30.770
Can I test it?

00:12:31.230 --> 00:12:33.190
Sure, head in over there.

00:12:50.040 --> 00:12:54.710
Campos has pulled onto Interstate 10 from US1.

00:12:54.710 --> 00:12:57.750
He is now heading west at one hundred miles per hour.

00:12:58.840 --> 00:13:00.750
I wonder if he's trying to get into Mexico?

00:13:02.420 --> 00:13:06.760
Also, I got the details on the armoured car. I'll send them to you now.

00:13:33.040 --> 00:13:37.040
When I get back to Mexico, I'll let my hair go black again.

00:13:37.040 --> 00:13:39.000
Be all "Adios, Blondie!"

00:13:40.290 --> 00:13:43.010
Wasn't blond your mother's request?

00:13:44.380 --> 00:13:45.510
Yeah, she was always saying that.

00:13:46.130 --> 00:13:49.350
Even after we came to the United States...

00:13:50.010 --> 00:13:55.060
She said even for white people, blond hair can be happier than black.

00:13:55.060 --> 00:13:56.640
Happiness, huh?

00:13:57.100 --> 00:13:59.440
She kept waiting for our runaway father.

00:14:00.310 --> 00:14:02.520
We were living hand to mouth, never sure if we would eat.

00:14:03.110 --> 00:14:05.610
She died with blond hair.

00:14:06.700 --> 00:14:07.860
Blond...

00:14:11.030 --> 00:14:11.580
Jose...

00:14:13.040 --> 00:14:16.580
You're the only kindness we know.

00:14:16.580 --> 00:14:19.960
If it's for you, I can do anything!

00:14:20.540 --> 00:14:22.500
We're family.

00:14:23.050 --> 00:14:28.050
Yes, when we get to Mexico, let's live happily together, with Richie. The three of us!

00:14:28.380 --> 00:14:30.340
Yes Sharon, let's do that.

00:14:57.660 --> 00:15:00.250
We will soon be at the destination.

00:15:13.430 --> 00:15:14.680
Shit...eat this!

00:15:21.150 --> 00:15:22.810
Am- Amazing!

00:15:23.360 --> 00:15:25.440
A bazooka means nothing to this thing!

00:15:25.440 --> 00:15:26.860
It really is a tank!

00:15:27.780 --> 00:15:29.650
Invincible...we're invincible!

00:15:30.280 --> 00:15:33.030
We're almost to Mexico! Step on it, sister!

00:15:46.250 --> 00:15:46.960
Idiot!

00:15:47.340 --> 00:15:49.670
I told you not to show yourself!

00:15:50.590 --> 00:15:53.090
You are supposed to take my place.

00:15:53.760 --> 00:15:54.760
What..

00:15:55.720 --> 00:15:57.310
What is this?

00:15:57.810 --> 00:15:59.100
What...

00:15:59.100 --> 00:15:59.810
Wh-

00:16:00.810 --> 00:16:02.980
Sorry Sharon, look:

00:16:02.980 --> 00:16:04.650
Keep your cool and drive.

00:16:06.320 --> 00:16:10.280
Just running away to Mexico won't set me free.

00:16:10.280 --> 00:16:14.950
You see, there are too many people who want me dead.

00:16:16.490 --> 00:16:19.330
After we cross the border, I'll burn the car.

00:16:19.750 --> 00:16:22.830
Your two burnt bodies will be inside it.

00:16:24.830 --> 00:16:27.500
The police will think I'm dead.

00:16:27.880 --> 00:16:30.920
Sure, they may check DNA and tooth structure,

00:16:30.920 --> 00:16:33.840
but it will give me enough time to properly escape.

00:16:33.840 --> 00:16:37.350
I will become gloriously free.

00:16:38.470 --> 00:16:40.350
We're family, aren't we?

00:16:40.350 --> 00:16:44.350
To survive, even family can be sold.

00:16:44.940 --> 00:16:47.520
You cheated us.

00:16:48.400 --> 00:16:50.360
Always lying to us!

00:16:50.900 --> 00:16:55.360
It depends on your attitude. I can help you, Sharon.

00:17:15.010 --> 00:17:18.470
Jose Campos is heading to Laredo with the intention of going to Mexico.

00:17:19.010 --> 00:17:21.680
We must stop him at San Antonio.

00:17:22.100 --> 00:17:25.890
So, for our pride, we cannot let him pass!

00:17:25.890 --> 00:17:30.900
But, that monster even survived a direct hit from a bazooka.

00:17:30.900 --> 00:17:35.700
I don't think armour piercing bullets will be effective enough.

00:17:36.110 --> 00:17:36.910
You know?

00:17:37.320 --> 00:17:37.660
Yeah.

00:17:42.660 --> 00:17:44.500
That's an odd gun.

00:17:44.870 --> 00:17:46.250
Was it issued to you?

00:17:46.790 --> 00:17:47.290
Yeah.

00:17:50.750 --> 00:17:51.500
Here they come!

00:17:57.430 --> 00:17:59.180
They just don't learn, do they?

00:17:59.510 --> 00:18:01.180
Come on, hit it!

00:18:14.650 --> 00:18:15.900
He's crazy!

00:18:19.950 --> 00:18:21.530
Drive faster!

00:19:08.290 --> 00:19:09.040
Are you okay?

00:19:09.410 --> 00:19:10.620
Are you hurt?

00:19:11.250 --> 00:19:13.170
I'm fine. Hurry and pursue them.

00:19:13.590 --> 00:19:14.040
Right!

00:20:25.490 --> 00:20:31.290
The runaway armoured car drama came to a surprising end in front of the border.

00:20:32.500 --> 00:20:39.500
We reported earlier that the principal offender, Jose Campos, was shot by his accomplice.

00:20:39.500 --> 00:20:45.510
However, according to the results of the investigation,

00:20:45.510 --> 00:20:50.520
it has been determined that an armour piercing bullet entered from the exhaust pipe under the car.

00:20:51.220 --> 00:20:55.020
No one can escape the god of death.

00:20:55.600 --> 00:21:03.070
The FBI believe a bullet must have gotten trapped in the wheel and projected upwards.

00:21:04.950 --> 00:21:07.030
As expected of Golgo 13.

00:21:07.450 --> 00:21:09.740
You have fulfilled our request.

00:21:30.640 --> 00:21:31.970
In my home country...

00:21:32.520 --> 00:21:35.270
the whiter a person's skin, the better.

00:21:35.810 --> 00:21:40.980
Even Caucasian blondes can attain higher positions than black haired ones.

00:21:41.980 --> 00:21:47.820
Because of this, women with black hair like myself desperately dye our hair blond.

00:21:54.410 --> 00:21:55.330
That's why...

00:21:56.540 --> 00:21:59.330
Men like Campos can appear.

00:22:00.090 --> 00:22:01.840
From now on...

00:22:02.750 --> 00:22:08.300
as long as we have to dye our hair, things will never change.

00:22:33.830 --> 00:22:39.080
It doesn't matter anymore

00:22:39.830 --> 00:22:44.630
Who craved freedom first

00:22:45.800 --> 00:22:53.510
How we decided to part, and how we loved each other

00:22:53.810 --> 00:22:55.850
As nostalgic and simply just that

00:22:55.850 --> 00:23:03.940
Once you've lost it you'll feel lonely

00:23:04.190 --> 00:23:07.860
You may have to overcome the pain

00:23:07.900 --> 00:23:13.120
Many times with that cruel heart of yours

00:23:13.160 --> 00:23:21.330
But you just can't become as strong as you've imagined

00:23:22.960 --> 00:23:25.920
It was just a dream

00:23:25.960 --> 00:23:29.340
So let us return to tomorrow

00:23:29.380 --> 00:23:34.350
In this calm night

00:23:34.390 --> 00:23:36.600
There'll only be wanderers

00:23:36.680 --> 00:23:41.730
But now you've awakened, so walk down that path of yours

00:23:41.770 --> 00:23:47.690
And even though time is fleeting

00:23:47.730 --> 00:23:54.160
People sometimes desire too much

00:24:01.790 --> 00:24:07.130
Female terrorist Catherine. After she lost her son, she became cruel and cold-hearted.

00:24:07.880 --> 00:24:11.550
She meets Golgo again as a comrade.

00:24:12.260 --> 00:24:14.800
They pile bodies again.

00:24:12.260 --> 00:24:13.260
LOL DOUBLE ENTENDRE

00:24:13.260 --> 00:24:13.970
LOL DOUBLE ENTENDRE

00:24:13.970 --> 00:24:14.510
LOL DOUBLE ENTENDRE

00:24:15.300 --> 00:24:20.060
Then, untold past incidents are revealed to Golgo.

00:24:20.430 --> 00:24:22.440
Next time, on Gorigo 13:

00:24:20.810 --> 00:24:26.060
Catherine the Cold-Blooded

00:24:22.440 --> 00:24:24.270
Catherine the Cold-Blooded

00:24:24.270 --> 00:24:28.360
Don't stand behind him if you value your life.
